<section class="flick-hero">
  <div class="marge-wrap flick-hero__grid">
    <div>
      <a class="marge-back-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}#games">← Back to Our Games</a>
      <p class="marge-eyebrow marge-eyebrow--pink">Available Now</p>
      <h1>Guess the movie one emoji at a time.</h1>
      <p class="marge-lede">Daily movie puzzles, solo levels, hints, streaks, and more—ready to play on iPhone.</p>
      <a class="marge-button" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flickmoji-guess-the-movie/id6779334071">Download on the App Store</a>
    </div>
    <div class="flick-phones" aria-label="Flickmoji gameplay screens">
      <span class="marge-stage marge-stage--midnight"></span>
      <span class="marge-phone marge-phone--home"><img src="https://jaceti.github.io/playmarge/v23-assets/01-home.webp" alt="Flickmoji home screen"></span>
      <span class="marge-phone marge-phone--game"><img src="https://jaceti.github.io/playmarge/v23-assets/07-solo-gameplay.webp" alt="Flickmoji movie puzzle screen"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flick-how" id="how">
  <div class="marge-wrap">
    <p class="marge-eyebrow marge-eyebrow--yellow">How It Works</p>
    <div class="flick-steps">
      <article><strong>1</strong><h3>Read the clues.</h3><p>Each movie is revealed through a sequence of emoji moments—one flick, told frame by frame.</p></article>
      <article><strong>2</strong><h3>Make your guess.</h3><p>Type the title, or use optional hints for the year, the initials, or the full solution.</p></article>
      <article><strong>3</strong><h3>Keep playing.</h3><p>Take on solo levels, return for the Daily Flick, and track your progress through your profile.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flick-feature">
  <div class="marge-wrap flick-feature__grid">
    <div class="flick-feature__phone"><img src="https://jaceti.github.io/playmarge/v23-assets/07-solo-gameplay.webp" alt="Flickmoji emoji movie puzzle"></div>
    <div><p class="marge-eyebrow marge-eyebrow--pink">Daily Flick</p><h2>Every movie tells a different emoji story.</h2><p>A fresh mystery movie every day. Guess in as few emojis as you can, then share your result and challenge a friend.</p><div class="marge-feature-pills"><span>Solo Levels</span><span>Daily Flick</span><span>Hints</span><span>Mascots</span><span>Badges</span><span>Streaks</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flick-download">
  <div class="marge-wrap">
    <p class="marge-eyebrow marge-eyebrow--cream">Available Now</p>
    <h2>Flickmoji is ready to play.</h2>
    <p>Take on today’s Daily Flick, build your streak, and keep the movie night going.</p>
    <a class="marge-button marge-button--light" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flickmoji-guess-the-movie/id6779334071">Download on the App Store</a>
  </div>
</section>

